---
import "../styles/global.css"
---

<main class="h-screen w-screen overflow-y-auto scroll-smooth [scrollbar-width:none] [-ms-overflow-style:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">

		<section class="flex items-center justify-center mt-20 h-[120px] max-830:mt-[110px] max-440:mt-[70px] max-440:mb-20">
			<div class="max-w-[1400px] w-full mx-auto px-[var(--section-padding-desktop)] max-830:px-[var(--section-padding-mobile)] flex items-center justify-center">
				<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 w-full">
					<h1 class="text-[#f1f1f1] m-0 mb-2 text-5xl max-830:text-[36px] font-bold text-center leading-tight">
						Void Presence Webhook
					</h1>
					<p class="text-[15px] max-830:text-[13px] text-[#95989d] m-0 max-w-[520px] text-center">
						Receive and process external events asynchronously via a single webhook endpoint.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-[var(--section-padding-desktop)] pt-8 max-md:px-[var(--section-padding-mobile)] max-md:pt-5">
			<div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
				<div class="w-full">
					<div class="grid gap-5 mb-5" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));">

						<div class="w-full box-border flex flex-col bg-[rgba(23,23,23,0.9)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] rounded-2xl p-[14px_16px] ">
							<h4 class="text-[#f1f1f1] m-0 mb-1 text-[13px] font-semibold">Overview</h4>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								This service exposes a single <code class="text-[#e4e4e7] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] px-1 py-px rounded text-[12px]">POST /webhook</code> endpoint that accepts incoming events from any external service.
							</p>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								Each request is validated, persisted to PostgreSQL, and published to RabbitMQ for async processing.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="w-full box-border flex flex-col bg-[rgba(23,23,23,0.9)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] rounded-2xl p-[14px_16px]">
							<h4 class="text-[#f1f1f1] m-0 mb-1 text-[13px] font-semibold">How it works</h4>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								Incoming events are queued via RabbitMQ and handled by a background worker independently of the HTTP response.
							</p>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								The API responds immediately with a success so the sender is never blocked waiting for processing to finish.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="w-full box-border flex flex-col bg-[rgba(23,23,23,0.9)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] rounded-2xl p-[14px_16px]">
							<h4 class="text-[#f1f1f1] m-0 mb-1 text-[13px] font-semibold">Setup</h4>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								Point any external service to <code class="text-[#e4e4e7] bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] px-1 py-px rounded text-[12px]">/webhook</code> and start sending POST requests with a JSON payload.
							</p>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 mb-4 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								The full source, environment variables, and Docker setup are available on GitHub.
							</p>
							<a
								href="https://github.com/Devollox/void-webhook"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noreferrer"
								class="mt-auto w-full text-white text-center bg-[#272727] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] rounded-xl px-4 py-[10px] text-[13px] font-medium no-underline transition-all duration-200 block hover:bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] hover:border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] hover:-translate-y-px hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]"
							>
								View source on GitHub
							</a>
						</div>

						<div class="w-full box-border flex flex-col bg-[rgba(23,23,23,0.9)] border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.04)] rounded-2xl p-[14px_16px]">
							<h4 class="text-[#f1f1f1] m-0 mb-1 text-[13px] font-semibold">Usage notes</h4>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								Redis is used for rate limiting and temporary caching — avoid flooding the endpoint with high-frequency requests.
							</p>
							<p class="text-[#a1a1aa] m-0 text-[13px] leading-tight">
								For heavy integrations, pre-process and batch events on your side before forwarding them here.
							</p>
						</div>

					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
